{"author":{"id":"609bf866d4a5d716c19faf5d617b3bf3de478230d29602d72aad5aa90a80466f"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1788976638,"nonce":"9rp1Bn4RMZST9pB/aTH4p3a+BYU=","message":"Labelled `perf-risk` for COMPILE time, not execute time. Its\npredecessor `RedundantGuardElim` is written, tested and deliberately unregistered\nbecause it cost ~4.8% of pipeline time to fire twice on the whole corpus.\n\nAnything built here has to earn its slot: restrict the analysis to loop headers\nand their guards rather than walking every CondJump, and re-measure\n`ASH_AIR_TIME_PASSES` on deltablue before registering. A pass that fires rarely\nis a pass that should not run.","files":null}]}